  m_Name: JournalPage
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Item
  itemName: 'Torn log page '
  itemIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 38c5ca6e6b78e204ca717fe8b746e669, type: 3}
  descriptionSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c1c02b08b2d91f4498c6afaf524f6a1b, type: 3}
  description: "A page where it is written: \"I can\u2019t wait anymore and just
    leave the days go by. It\u2019s as if my reason for moving forward had been taken
    away... You understand me and I know it, this ordeal brings us together. I refuse
    to stay shut away at home, I refuse to be passive, I have to say goodbye to her.  
    -See you soon, my love, I\u2019ll be back soon. [signature] \""
